When Results catchup is idle, start Company Overview every 15 minutes
(and yield back if Results gets work again). About and Results use any
available GEMINI_API_KEY* (prefer feature key, then fall back). Keep
90d catchup lookback, idle backoff, and YoY/comparison dedupe.
